<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sold 44.65 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sold 44.65 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 44.65 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 140.66 the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
